1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,835
It has four phases.

2
00:00:01,835 --> 00:00:04,869
A slow lag phase, while cells get ready.

3
00:00:04,869 --> 00:00:08,736
A log phase, when growth is exponential.

4
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:13,502
A deceleration phase, as space and resources run short.

5
00:00:13,502 --> 00:00:16,041
And a stationary phase, at maturity.

